// @ens-test --jobs 2
// @exit 1
// @stdout-contains FAIL the first test ends the program: the test ended the program with code 3
// @stdout-contains PASS the second test passes
// @stdout-contains FAIL the third test panics: panic: stopped here
// @stdout-contains 1/3 tests passed
// Two worker programs stop, one on an exit and one on a panic. Each fails the one test it was
// running, and every other test still gets its result.
